{"seq":3,"slug":"automatic-curriculum","title":"自动课程 (RL)","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/curriculum-learning-strategies/adaptive/automatic-curriculum","wordCount":1874,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"自动课程-rl\">自动课程 (RL)</h1><p>教师-学生课程在任务可枚举时很优雅，但强化学习常面对的是参数化生成的开放任务空间——一个迷宫生成器能造出近乎无穷的关卡。这时课程不再是&quot;从固定集合里挑任务&quot;，而是&quot;按需生成难度恰好卡在能力边缘的新任务&quot;。自动课程学习（automatic curriculum learning, ACL）与无监督环境设计（UED）就是为这个生成式场景而生，它是开放式学习与稳健智能体训练的核心引擎。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>设环境由参数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span>（关卡布局、初始状态、对手强度等）刻画，自动课程的目标是动态维护一个任务分布 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>τ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_t(\\tau)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，使学生策略在其上的训练始终高效。关键准则不是&quot;任务难不难&quot;，而是&quot;任务还能不能教会学生东西&quot;——一个学生已经稳过的任务和一个学生完全无望的任务，都没有教学价值；最有价值的是处在<strong>可解但有挑战</strong>边缘的任务。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[参数化任务生成器] --&gt; B[采样候选任务 tau]&#10;  B --&gt; C[学生策略在 tau 上 rollout]&#10;  C --&gt; D[算学习潜力评分&lt;br/&gt;遗憾/GAE/新颖性]&#10;  D --&gt; E{评分高?}&#10;  E --&gt;|是| F[存入优先回放缓冲&lt;br/&gt;多训练]&#10;  E --&gt;|否| G[丢弃或低优先级]&#10;  F --&gt; H[学生更新策略]&#10;  H --&gt; I[学生能力前沿外推]&#10;  I --&gt; B\">flowchart TD\n  A[参数化任务生成器] --&gt; B[采样候选任务 tau]\n  B --&gt; C[学生策略在 tau 上 rollout]\n  C --&gt; D[算学习潜力评分&lt;br/&gt;遗憾/GAE/新颖性]\n  D --&gt; E{评分高?}\n  E --&gt;|是| F[存入优先回放缓冲&lt;br/&gt;多训练]\n  E --&gt;|否| G[丢弃或低优先级]\n  F --&gt; H[学生更新策略]\n  H --&gt; I[学生能力前沿外推]\n  I --&gt; B</pre><p>这条回路与教师-学生同构，但教师从&quot;选离散摇臂&quot;升级为&quot;在连续参数空间里评分并生成任务&quot;。统一到<a href=\"../foundations/curriculum-taxonomy\">课程范式谱系</a>的框架，这里 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>score</mtext><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>τ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{score}_t(\\tau)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">score</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 取的是学习潜力，且 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span> 的支撑集可超出任何预收集的数据——这正是该篇所说的&quot;挑选 vs 生成&quot;第三轴的生成端。</p>\n<h2 id=\"prioritized-level-replay-学习潜力优先\">Prioritized Level Replay：学习潜力优先</h2><p>PLR（Jiang 等人，2021）是这一族最有影响的方法。它的洞察是：随机采样关卡浪费算力在已学会或学不会的关卡上，应当<strong>按学习潜力优先回放</strong>。PLR 维护一个关卡缓冲，每个关卡用一个评分函数估计其&quot;还能教多少&quot;，常用基于 GAE（广义优势估计）的 TD 误差幅度——优势的绝对值大，说明价值函数对该关卡预测不准、还有学习空间。学生优先在高分关卡上训练，关卡评分随训练动态更新。其采样概率混合了学习潜力与&quot;久未访问&quot;的新鲜度：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>τ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>ρ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mfrac><mrow><mtext>score</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>τ</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>β</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><munder><mo>∑</mo><msup><mi>τ</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup></munder><mtext>score</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>τ</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>β</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>ρ</mi><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>staleness</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>τ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(\\tau) = (1-\\rho)\\,\\frac{\\text{score}(\\tau)^{1/\\beta}}{\\sum_{\\tau&#x27;}\\text{score}(\\tau&#x27;)^{1/\\beta}} + \\rho\\,P_\\text{staleness}(\\tau)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.5687em;vertical-align:-1.0037em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.565em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.296em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1783em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6828em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.786em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">score</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6779em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.814em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">score</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.888em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.0037em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">staleness</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span> 是温度、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span></span></span></span></span> 平衡潜力与新鲜度。PLR 不需要训练独立的教师网络，纯靠评分缓冲，因此轻量且与各种 RL 算法正交。</p>\n<h2 id=\"遗憾驱动与无监督环境设计\">遗憾驱动与无监督环境设计</h2><p>PLR 的&quot;学习潜力&quot;还可以替换成更有理论根基的<strong>遗憾</strong>（regret）。在 UED 框架里，环境生成器被建模成一个对手，它生成的任务要最大化学生的遗憾——即学生当前策略与最优策略之间的回报差。直觉是：遗憾大的任务恰是学生&quot;本可以做好却没做好&quot;的任务，最有教学价值；而学生完全无望的任务遗憾未必大（最优策略也做不好），会被自然排除，这避免了纯&quot;最大化难度&quot;的对手把学生推向不可解任务的灾难。下表对照这一族的几种评分准则：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>评分准则</th>\n<th>偏好的任务</th>\n<th>优点</th>\n<th>风险</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>GAE/TD 误差（PLR）</td>\n<td>价值预测最不准的</td>\n<td>轻量、无需教师网</td>\n<td>与价值函数误差耦合</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>遗憾（minimax-regret UED）</td>\n<td>本可做好却没做好的</td>\n<td>理论保证、排除不可解</td>\n<td>遗憾难精确估，需近似</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>新颖性/多样性</td>\n<td>状态访问最稀疏的</td>\n<td>鼓励探索覆盖</td>\n<td>可能追逐无意义新颖</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>纯难度（朴素对手）</td>\n<td>学生回报最低的</td>\n<td>实现简单</td>\n<td>易把学生推向不可解任务</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>PAIRED、Robust PLR 等方法用遗憾近似（如两个学生的回报差）来实现这一准则。2025 年的工作把这套思路推广到机器人崎岖地形运动、自动驾驶场景生成等，共同主题是<strong>对抗者需被约束以保证任务可解</strong>——驾驶场景生成里让对抗者充当正则、确保生成任务&quot;困难但仍可解&quot;，从而得到稳定课程。</p>\n<h2 id=\"课程引发的非平稳性与稳定性\">课程引发的非平稳性与稳定性</h2><p>自动课程把训练数据分布变成了随策略演化的移动靶，这给优化带来一个静态课程没有的麻烦：学生面对的任务分布在持续漂移，而强化学习本就对非平稳分布敏感。若课程推进得太快，学生还没在当前任务前沿站稳，分布就被推向更难的任务，价值函数估计跟不上、策略震荡甚至崩溃——这与<a href=\"../difficulty/pacing-functions\">调度函数</a>里&quot;边界放得太猛&quot;的失败同源，只是这里的边界由算法自动决定，更难察觉。</p>\n<p>实务上有几条稳住课程的护栏。其一是<strong>回放旧任务</strong>：定期把已经学会的关卡按低优先级混回训练，防止学生在追逐新前沿时遗忘旧能力，这与<a href=\"../continual-lifelong-learning/methods/replay-rehearsal\">持续学习</a>的回放完全同构。其二是<strong>约束课程推进速度</strong>，让任务分布的漂移速率与学生价值函数的更新速率匹配。其三是给生成式对手加<strong>可解性约束</strong>——前述驾驶/机器人工作的核心教训正是：不加约束的&quot;最大化难度&quot;对手会把学生推向不可解任务，使课程发散。这三条共同指向一个原则：自动课程的价值不在于尽快变难，而在于始终把任务分布稳稳卡在学生能力前沿的薄薄一层上。</p>\n<h2 id=\"与-rl-探索-奖励设计的边界\">与 RL 探索、奖励设计的边界</h2><p>自动课程极易与强化学习的其他机制混淆，划界很重要。它<strong>不是</strong>探索策略——探索（如 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\epsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span></span></span></span></span>-贪婪、内在奖励）决定在<strong>给定任务内</strong>怎么找新状态，自动课程决定<strong>给学生哪个任务</strong>；二者正交且常配合，前者属<a href=\"../reinforcement-learning/rl-foundations/exploration-exploitation\">探索与利用</a>。它也<strong>不是</strong>奖励设计——奖励定义&quot;在一个任务里什么算好&quot;，自动课程定义&quot;训练哪些任务&quot;，前者属<a href=\"../reinforcement-learning/rl-foundations/reward-design\">奖励设计</a>。值得一提的是，这套&quot;按可学性自动生成难度序列&quot;的思想正在反哺 LLM 后训练：2025 年的可验证奖励 RL（如数学/代码 RLVR）开始用学生通过率筛选&quot;既非全对也非全错&quot;的题目，本质就是自动课程，详见<a href=\"../practice/data-curriculum-llm\">LLM 数据课程</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>自动课程面向参数化生成的开放任务空间，目标是动态维护任务分布 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>τ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_t(\\tau)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，偏好&quot;可解但有挑战&quot;、仍能教会学生的任务，而非单纯最难的任务。</li>\n<li>PLR 用基于 GAE 的学习潜力评分优先回放关卡，混合潜力与新鲜度采样，轻量且与 RL 算法正交。</li>\n<li>遗憾驱动的 UED 有理论根基，能自然排除不可解任务；对抗式生成须约束对手以保证任务可解（2025 年驾驶/机器人工作的共识）。</li>\n<li>自动课程不等于探索策略（任务内找新状态）或奖励设计（任务内定义好坏）；其思想正反哺 LLM 可验证奖励后训练的题目筛选。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>本 hub：<a href=\"teacher-student-curriculum\">教师-学生课程</a>（自动课程的离散前身）、<a href=\"../foundations/curriculum-taxonomy\">课程范式谱系</a>（生成式第三轴）、<a href=\"../practice/data-curriculum-llm\">LLM 数据课程</a>（自动课程在 RLVR 题目筛选中的落地）。</li>\n<li>跨 hub：<a href=\"../reinforcement-learning/rl-foundations/exploration-exploitation\">探索与利用</a>、<a href=\"../reinforcement-learning/rl-foundations/reward-design\">奖励设计</a>（与自动课程正交的两个 RL 机制）。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"自动课程 (RL)","id":"自动课程-rl"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Prioritized Level Replay：学习潜力优先","id":"prioritized-level-replay-学习潜力优先"},{"level":2,"text":"遗憾驱动与无监督环境设计","id":"遗憾驱动与无监督环境设计"},{"level":2,"text":"课程引发的非平稳性与稳定性","id":"课程引发的非平稳性与稳定性"},{"level":2,"text":"与 RL 探索、奖励设计的边界","id":"与-rl-探索-奖励设计的边界"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"教师-学生课程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/curriculum-learning-strategies/adaptive/teacher-student-curriculum"},"next":{"title":"LLM 数据课程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/curriculum-learning-strategies/practice/data-curriculum-llm"}}